### AuthService REST Client Requests
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Register New User
# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "tester01",
  "email": "tester01@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe"
}

### 3. Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "tester01",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 4. Get Current User Principal (Reads ACCESS_TOKEN cookie or Bearer token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me

### 5. Get Full Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me

### 6. Update Email
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newEmail": "tester01_updated@example.com"
}

### 7. Refresh Token (Rotates refresh token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 8. Change Password
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/change-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "oldPassword": "Password123!",
  "newPassword": "NewPassword456!@"
}

### 9. Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout

### 10. Swagger Docs
GET {{baseUrl}}/swagger/v1/swagger.json
